ders lower-band-v1 with input {rendering}. Calls host. Records. Good. The test passed (8 tests). Confirmed.\n\n- One thing: the `summarizeToolResult` op in the test passes `{ toolName: \"read\", content: \"c\", outcome: \"succeeded\" }`. The adapter bounds content (maxInputChars 200000, \"c\" is small). Renders tool-result-v1. Good.\n\nEverything checks out. Let me re-run green-verify to confirm the final state, then re-emit the JSON (with the comment-fix added to findingsFixed and changedFiles).\n\nLet me run green-verify.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d429f632-d6b9-4c8a-a0e2-2802260578d5","uuid":"f0a44a08-4168-47e5-9e73-02a229a736ee"}
